### Login para obter o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:40001/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### InsertPasto
POST http://localhost:40001/insertPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Teste",
    "areatotal": 10
}

### GetAllPasto
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetPastoByID
GET http://localhost:40001/getPastoByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### UpdatePasto
PUT http://localhost:40001/updatePasto/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "descricao": "Pasto Teste Alterado",
    "areatotal": 15
}

### DeletePasto (soft delete)
DELETE http://localhost:40001/deletePasto/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### GetAllPasto depois do delete (o registro removido não deve aparecer)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPasto HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Teste sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET http://localhost:40001/getAllPasto HTTP/1.1
